{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"6298a4d360dd958d3f065eedff82031218f9df62f058ee674a1b51b85bf85c22","ja":"想いの発表会","zh":"心意的发表会","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"cc443a9c752b8edf50a1105a5853f1163dd9099c73dffca2868ab21dd7b5ee11","ja":"今回の3人のお仕事は、バラエティ番組出演。\n学校で、中学生が想いを発表する場を見届ける役で……","zh":"这次3个人的工作是出演综艺节目。\n她们要在学校里，见证初中生表达心声的场面……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"810b26a4d402d98627bf058a5ff4ab4a113cc96eed2295a8c85644f699b0af31","ja":"こんにちは！　今日はこのステージで、\n言いたいことをぜひ、発表してください！","zh":"你好！今天请务必在这个舞台上，\n把想说的话发表出来吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"418c2fb8c93a048f64161f3aba0cb9205290f595462d51fd786b0d73ee237791","ja":"みんなが青春しているところ、\n茜ちゃんたちにい～っぱい、見せつけちゃってね☆","zh":"大家尽情挥洒青春的模样，\n要好好地展现给小茜她们看哦☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"50084f4af02e845d482ba51eb6cb2d269af0e29a058644e0f51254056207cb67","ja":"ステージに立つのって緊張しちゃうよね！\nでもアタシたちがそばにいるから、頑張ってね！","zh":"站上舞台总是会让人紧张呢！\n不过有我们在你身边，加油哦！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"1089dab58f8636c9ce337470e832238416a9a81428dfa2a62e26270ff2b0b588","ja":"「は～～～～いっ！」","zh":"“到～～～～啦！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"8e1760c246ddf6c9489bbab74570c12a966c546893cb022dc770be0ca99fe88e","ja":"「僕は～……人気者になりたいです！\nみんなを楽しい気持ちにさせた～い！」","zh":"“我嘛～……想成为大红人！\n想让大家的心情都变愉快～！”","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"cd11ca5f4ae107f385d316ab788e78fbf7fa5e9a504bc73f537749d38bb8ac4f","ja":"ふっふっふ、それなら、\n茜ちゃんを参考にするといいよ♪","zh":"呵呵呵，那样的话，\n参考小茜就可以啦♪","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"212ba3a8e95c90ff503994bff65e90b36f38f873dbe5248aa413b9b5c0149eca","ja":"そうだね！\n私も茜ちゃんといると、すっごく楽しいから！","zh":"说得对！\n因为我和小茜在一起的时候，也超级开心！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"4fb1f44974f0451218c299e4381595451a1e367c33f162cbafd225c3df465d81","ja":"アタシも～！　茜みたいに、自分が楽しいって\n思うことから、やってみればいいんじゃないかな？","zh":"我也是～！像茜那样，先从自己觉得开心的事情\n开始做起，不也挺好的嘛？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"91875b6466170843436af895182faf88f9f33061737df95593b2e050b19483f4","ja":"こうして、順調に番組の収録は進んでいき……","zh":"就这样，节目的录制顺利进行着……","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"8e36abfced3f1ee6401add74a903d6201cba192c92677d98d54fab940412f9bf","ja":"みんな、すっごく熱いね！\nそれじゃあ次は……おっと、大丈夫？　緊張してる？","zh":"大家，热情都好高涨呢！\n那么接下来是……哎呀，没事吧？很紧张吗？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"f1aac5af37b5ec56a5912ed367daec57cb7c2977345cd3d7b2d157407ce1fd64","ja":"「は、はい……すみません。その……\n今日はどうしても、ある人に伝えたいことがあって」","zh":"「是、是的……对不起。那个……\n今天我无论如何，都有一件事想告诉某个人」","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"4584978e84794180f3cf7e586786db79de39de64f5dc21a26fa4e1b130f7d266","ja":"こ、これって、もしかして……告白！？","zh":"这、这难道是……告白！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"25277b38faff09a424e4edfa346918945ff63362cdcbffc5735beea30ceb2904","ja":"きっとそうだよ！　くるかもって思ってたけど、\n本当にきちゃうなんて！！","zh":"肯定就是这样！虽然之前就觉得可能会来，\n但没想到真的来了！！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1675.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"9cf1fe9e28cd98849aff93987a1efee1d18e1976d9e74ab3a5d63fad806dc95c","ja":"ア、アタシまで緊張してきちゃった……！\nあの子の気持ちが、伝わりますように……。","zh":"连、连我都开始紧张起来了……！\n希望那孩子的心意，能够传达出去……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
